# .easignore
# ============================================
# ✅ Fichier/dossier TSY tokony ho ao anaty tarball alefa any EAS Build.
# EAS dia mampiasa .gitignore raha tsy misy .easignore, fa satria ny
# backend (Python) dia tsy ilaina mihitsy ho an'ny build Expo/mobile,
# dia atao mazava tsara eto ny fanilihana azy.
# ============================================

# ✅ Backend Python (venv) — io no nahatonga ny error EPERM torch_cpu.lib
backend/venv
backend/.venv
venv
.venv
**/venv
**/.venv
**/site-packages

# ✅ Python caches
**/__pycache__
*.pyc

# ✅ Node
node_modules
**/node_modules

